{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration/recovery policy in specifications. The policy gives forward motion priority in clear space, inserts occasional random_walk for coverage diversity, routes every obstacle event through short directed recovery, uses move_backward only for front-obstacle escape, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort state after repeated front blockage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability in G",
    "Use one main policy specification plus small anti-repetition specifications to avoid endless turning or random-walk repetition"
  ],
